data.solution-stack-based-buffers#Solution: S:
Replaced all dynamic String allocations with stack-based character buffers:
DallasTemperatureNode.cpp:
// Before: setProperty(cTemperature).send(String(_temperature)); // After: char buffer[20]; Utils::floatToString(_temperature, buffer, sizeof(buffer)); setProperty(cTemperature).send(buffer);
